> Everything I have:
> =A0a - 16461 gold pieces
I'd buy another 2 levels of protection, unless your naked AC is
already 1, in which case I guess you could buy clairvoyance instead.

> =A0Amulets
check

> =A0Weapons
> =A0g - a blessed +0 silver saber
> =A0h - the blessed +2 Grayswandir
> =A0m - the blessed rustproof +1 Excalibur
check

I usually save up all those elven daggers, and then cancel / bless /
enchant them to make a stack once I get 8-10.
You could trek back to the mines and get a stack on ordinary, unrusted
daggers either.
It's probably worth spending a b?oEW to get them to +1-3 at that
point.  But don't waste it on the rusty ones unless you have spare
oil.
Mind you, a valk with low AC (< -30) and those artifacts probably
won't need to throw daggers all that often, but they're still handy to
have.

> =A0Armor
check
Elven helms can be nice, as they can be safely enchanted to +7, but
the ordinary helmet is fine until you know there isn't a HoT / HoB
sitting in the castle armoury.
Same with the gloves.  As long as you have something to cover your
hands, what it is isn't that important in my experience

> =A0Comestibles
check

> =A0Scrolls
> =A0g - a blessed scroll of gold detection
> =A0h - 3 uncursed scrolls of gold detection
keep these for the planes

> =A0j - an uncursed scroll of enchant weapon
> =A0k - an uncursed scroll of taming
> =A0l - a cursed scroll of remove curse
> =A0n - an uncursed scroll of enchant armor
I would bless these, and use the EA on your t-shirt.  Cancel the t-
shirt first if you're going to cancel other stuff anyway, otherwise
don't bother.
The rest can be blanked, ready for your next marker.

> =A0Spellbooks
bless one and read it.  If you have enough holy water, bless one of
each type and read it.  Valks aren't bad at magic missle & cone of
cold once you train to basic.  Then stash them all - those things are
heavy.

> =A0Potions
> =A0a - 8 blessed potions called water
check

> =A0g - an uncursed potion of booze
> =A0h - an uncursed potion of paralysis
> =A0i - a blessed potion of full healing
> =A0k - an uncursed potion of acid
useful to hold onto.  Throw a scroll of fire into that list too, in
case of slimes.

> =A0l - 2 uncursed potions of gain ability
I would bless and quaff these now

> =A0m - a blessed potion of gain level
Umm... tricky.  You're not going to get any more intrinsics from
levelling up, so unless you turn into a spellcaster, I guess my advice
would be to save it and curse it for the ascension run.  I probably
wouldn't take my own advice here though, I tend to level up whenever I
can even if I've no good reason for doing so.

> =A0n - a cursed potion of extra healing
> =A0p - an uncursed potion of full healing
> =A0q - 2 uncursed potions of extra healing
> =A0t - a blessed potion of extra healing
I guess you can either save these for blessing and alchemising, or
just bless and quaff 'em for more maxHP.  I tend to do the latter.

The rest need dilution - ideally up at that fountain on level 2 where
you might get yet another wish out it...
If you're low on fountains, cancel them first, and you'll only have to
dilute a stack of juice.

> =A0Rings
check
although free action is still missing, and ideally you'll want
levitation from a ring rather than boots.  Boots work fine though.

> =A0Wands
check
/oCold is worth keeping an eye out for.  Being able to freeze water in
one turn is great.
I tend to keep /oCancels in my stash so I don't explode my stuff, but
they can be useful against disenchanters and the like.

> =A0Tools
check
Try and pick up a spare unihorn.  I love stethoscopes, but I don't
come across them in every game.  I know some people even wish for
them, but I'd wait until you're stuck for things to wish for before
thinking about that.  A can of grease can save your life too.

> =A0Gems
> =A0o - 2 blessed luckstones
stash these, you have the orb
As for the rest... well, you can keep 'em if you like, I guess*.  You
should be lucky enough not to need to throw any at white unicorns, but
the option is there.
If you want you can poly the glass.  I once got 21 dilithium crystals
doing that.  Probably a waste of poly charges though.

